dropped the body of system-header function
--
libc++ (LLVM 18) std::views::transform.  Fixed layers: the out-of-class
member class template __iterator of the constrained transform_view
(cpp20_member_class_template_of_constrained_class_template) and its
constrained converting constructor
(cpp20_constrained_converting_constructor_of_class_template).  Remaining:
transform_view's two end() overloads differ only in their requires-clauses
(cpp20_same_signature_members_differing_in_constraints), so the range-for
compares an __iterator with a __sentinel.  clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++
accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
